relist page 1 of 2 (new object): runs none
relist page 2 of 2 (swap): runs ns/live; ns/new waits its turn (one slot): True
dispatch with gone keys ahead of a live one: ns/live
requeue 60s at t=1000: sleeper ns/live at 61000
requeue 30s at t=3000: sleeper ns/live at 33000
requeue 90s at t=5000: sleeper none
stale sleeper wakes: runs none
the key's own sleeper wakes: runs ns/live
watch ends whole: resume at once
watch cut mid-stream: back off
watch closed before answering: back off
own metrics:
# TYPE keys gauge
keys 2
# TYPE syncs_total counter
syncs_total{b="a"} 3
syncs_total{b="c"} 1

a 429 naming its delay: RetryIn 7000ms: api: 429 TooManyRequests: slow down (retry after 7s)
a proxy's 429, Retry-After: 4 and a text body: RetryIn 4000ms: api: 429 : non-JSON error body (retry after 4s)
a Retry-After of 99999999s, capped: RetryIn 1000000ms: api: 429 : non-JSON error body (retry after 99999999s)
a 500 without one: Retry api: 500 InternalError: boom
tokens in the first second (a fraction carries over) at qps 1, 3, 7, 50, 75, 333, 1000: 1 2 6 50 74 333 1000
watches across clusters: /api/v1/configmaps@main x2 /api/v1/configmaps@host x2 /api/v1/pods@host x1
pools for other clusters: https://far:443 https://host:443
a server in logs: https://10.0.0.1:443 (kubernetes.default.svc)
